Package: focus
Type: Package
Title: Online Changepoint Detection in Univariate and Multivariate data streams
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2025-10-23
Authors@R: person("Gaetano", "Romano", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "g.romano@lancaster.ac.uk")
Maintainer: Gaetano Romano <g.romano@lancaster.ac.uk>
Description: focus is a high-performance package for online changepoint detection in univariate and multivariate data streams. It provides efficient C++ implementations of the FOCUS, MD-FOCUS and NP-FOCUS algorithms, with R and Python interfaces for real-time monitoring and offline analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.1.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
